sequenceDiagram
    title UC-15 - Submit Meeting for Approval
    actor Organizer as Meeting Organizer
    participant Page as Management Page
    participant API as Meeting API
    participant Service as Meeting Service
    participant M as Meeting Repo
    participant U as User Repo
    participant DB as Database

    opt Meeting is Rejected
        Organizer->>Page: Return meeting to Draft
        Page->>API: POST /api/meetings/{id}/transitions, action=ReturnToDraft
        API->>Service: ReturnToDraft(meetingId, actor)
        Service->>M: Lock and load meeting
        M->>DB: SELECT meeting FOR UPDATE
        DB-->>M: Current meeting
        M-->>Service: Rejected meeting owned by Organizer
        Service->>M: Set Draft, clear assignment, append history
        M->>DB: Save status and history atomically
        DB-->>M: Commit
        M-->>Service: Transition committed
        Service-->>API: Success, rejection history retained
        API-->>Page: 200 OK
        Page-->>Organizer: Confirm Draft restored
        Note over Organizer,Page: No invitation is created. Organizer may now edit the meeting.
    end

    Organizer->>Page: Edit Draft and open approver picker
    Page->>API: GET /api/meetings/approvers
    API->>Service: List eligible approvers
    Service->>U: Find active users with capability
    U->>DB: Query eligible users
    DB-->>U: Eligible approver list
    U-->>Service: Eligible approver list
    Service-->>API: Eligible approver list
    API-->>Page: 200 OK
    Page-->>Organizer: Display eligible approvers
    Organizer->>Page: Select approver and submit
    Page->>API: POST /api/meetings/{id}/transitions, action=SubmitForApproval, assignedApproverId
    API->>Service: SubmitForApproval(meetingId, actor, approverId)
    Service->>M: Lock meeting and load agenda
    M->>DB: Read meeting and agenda
    DB-->>M: Persisted meeting and agenda
    M-->>Service: Current data
    Service->>Service: Check Organizer, Draft, and readiness

    alt Meeting is not Draft
        Service-->>API: 409 MEETING_STATUS_CONFLICT
        API-->>Page: Refresh meeting status
    else Required information is incomplete
        Service-->>API: 400 MEETING_SUBMISSION_NOT_READY
        API-->>Page: Show field errors
    else Meeting is ready
        Service->>U: Validate active approver and capability
        U->>DB: Check account and meeting_approver
        DB-->>U: Eligibility result
        U-->>Service: Eligibility result
        alt Approver is no longer eligible
            Service-->>API: 400 MEETING_APPROVER_INVALID
            API-->>Page: Ask Organizer to select another approver
        else Approver is eligible
            Service->>M: Assign approver, set WaitingApproval, append history
            Service->>M: Queue approval notification
            M->>DB: Commit meeting, history, and notification
            DB-->>M: Commit
            M-->>Service: Submission committed
            Service-->>API: Success
            API-->>Page: 200 OK
            Page-->>Organizer: Show submission confirmation
        end
    end

    Note over Organizer,Service: Rejected cannot transition directly to WaitingApproval. ReturnToDraft must commit first.
